<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<kml v="1" site="nickles-testnet.custom" epoch="1">
  <head>
    <title>Nickles testnet</title>
    <meta name="headline" content="Donation-ranked placements with no impressions, clicks, or profiles."/>
    <meta name="tags" content="nickles, ads, testnet, privacy"/>
  </head>
  <body>
    <page>
      <h1>Nickles testnet</h1>
      <badge>ad network slice · testnet only · no tracking</badge>
      <p>A placement is a sealed card in the lower-left slot. Its rank comes from donations, not
      from an auction, and the browser never reports an impression or a click back to the ad
      network.</p>
      <p>This is a testnet surface. Nothing here is money, and the production settlement path is
      still an open question.</p>
    </page>
  </body>
</kml>
